@startuml
title RF24 — Responder mensagens do inbox · Máquina de estados: InboxMessage.status
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #FFF7EE
skinparam StateBorderColor #DC5B26
state "UNREAD" as UNREAD
UNREAD : criada por evento do jogo
UNREAD : conta no badge
state "READ" as READ
READ : aberta
READ : aguarda decisão se há opções
state "ANSWERED" as ANSWERED
ANSWERED : chosenOption gravada
ANSWERED : consequência aplicada (RF41)
state "EXPIRED" as EXPIRED
EXPIRED : deadlineWeek ultrapassada
EXPIRED : consequência padrão
state "ARCHIVED" as ARCHIVED
ARCHIVED : fora da lista principal
[*] --> UNREAD
UNREAD --> READ : abrir
READ --> ANSWERED : POST /respond válido
UNREAD --> EXPIRED : WeekCompleted > deadlineWeek
READ --> EXPIRED : WeekCompleted > deadlineWeek
READ --> ARCHIVED : sem opções / arquivar
ANSWERED --> ARCHIVED : arquivar
EXPIRED --> ARCHIVED : arquivar
ARCHIVED --> [*]
@enduml
